1. [READ] Collect news articles about tech companies. | out news_articles | api A | args {"categoryCode": "tech", "size": 100}
2. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of collected news articles. | out sentiment_analysis | api C | args {"tickers": "AAPL,TSLA,GOOGL", "date_to": "today", "tickers_mentions": "all", "domains": "all"}
3. [READ] Retrieve current stock prices for tech companies. | out stock_prices | api D | args {"symbol": "AAPL", "ticker": "TSLA", "symbol": "GOOGL"}
4. [PROCESS] Match news articles to corresponding stock prices. | out matched_articles | api B | args {"companyId": "AAPL", "companyId": "TSLA", "companyId": "GOOGL"}
5. [LOCAL] Generate daily summary report of top movers. | out summary_report | api E | args {"text": "$step4.matched_articles", "summary_size": 0.1}
6. [WRITE] Save summary report to spreadsheet. | out saved_report | api F | args {"apiKey": "your_api_key", "accessToken": "your_access_token", "companyId": "company_id", "tokenSecret": "your_token_secret", "apiSecret": "your_api_secret", "dateMacro": "today", "summarizeColumnBy": "all", "department": "finance", "agingMethod": "default", "reportDate": "today", "qzurl": "your_qz_url"}

1. [READ] Search for flight status for flight IDs FL123 and FL456. | out flight_status_data | api A | args {"flight_ids": ["FL123", "FL456"]}
2. [READ] Check current weather at Paris and Rome. | out weather_data | api A | args {"cities": ["Paris"]} | api B | args {"city": "Rome"}
3. [PROCESS] Convert ticket prices to home currency from USD to EUR. | out converted_prices | api C | args {"source_currency": "USD", "target_currency": "EUR"} | deps [1, 2]
4. [LOCAL] Format summary notification including flight statuses, weather updates, and price conversions. | out summary_notification | api D | args {}
5. [WRITE] Send push notification to phone with the summary notification. | out notification_sent | api E | args {"url": "$user.pushsafer_url", "message_type": "text", "note": "$user.note", "device_type": "android"} | deps [4]

1. [LOCAL] Define list of favorite stocks and cryptocurrencies. | out favorite_assets | params {}
2. [READ] Retrieve real-time stock and crypto prices for the defined assets. | out prices_data | api A | args {"symbol": "$step1.favorite_assets"}
3. [LOCAL] Detect significant price movements above a predefined threshold. | out significant_movements | api A | args {"symbol": "$step1.favorite_assets", "threshold": "significant change"}
4. [READ] Search for relevant financial news articles containing keywords related to the favorite assets. | out news_articles | api A | args {"keywords": ["favorite stocks", "crypto"]}
5. [LOCAL] Filter articles by time and relevance. | out filtered_articles | api A | args {"page": "1", "limit": "10", "all_tickers_mentions": "true", "date_to": "today", "tickers": "$step1.favorite_assets", "domains": "finance"}
6. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of selected articles. | out sentiment_analysis | api A | args {"ticker": "$step1.favorite_assets", "count": "10"}
7. [LOCAL] Extract key points and summarize content from the analyzed articles. | out summary | api A | args {"text": "$step6.sentiment_analysis"}
8. [WRITE] Compose email with summary and sentiment analysis. | out email_content | api A | args {"text": "$step7.summary"}
9. [WRITE] Send email to specified recipient. | out email_sent | api A | args {"email": "$user.email", "subject": "Daily Financial News Summary", "text": "$step8.email_content"}

1. [READ] Fetch latest articles from tech news sites. | out articles | api D | args {"start_date": "now-7d", "end_date": "now", "language": "en"}
2. [LOCAL] Define company name to monitor. | out company_name | api A | args {"company_name": "MyCompany"}
3. [PROCESS] Filter articles mentioning company name. | out filtered_articles | api B | args {"srchTerm": "$step2.company_name"}
4. [LOCAL] Summarize filtered articles. | out article_summaries | api C | args {"article_ids": "$step3.filtered_articles.article_ids"}
5. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of article summaries. | out sentiment_scores | api E | args {"article_summaries": "$step4.article_summaries.summary"}
6. [LOCAL] Create lead record in CRM. | out lead_record | api F | args {"summary": "$step4.article_summaries.summary", "sentiment_score": "$step5.sentiment_scores.score"}
7. [WRITE] Add lead record to CRM. | out success | api G | args {"lead_record": "$step6.lead_record"}

1. [READ] Get top trending tracks from music chart. | out trending_tracks | api D | args {"country": "US"}
2. [LOCAL] Parse track names and artist names from $step1.trending_tracks. | out parsed_tracks | api A | args {}
3. [READ] Search for lyrics of each song. | out lyrics_data | api A | args {"tracks": $parsed_tracks}
4. [LOCAL] Extract relevant lyrics for each song. | out extracted_lyrics | api A | args {}
5. [PROCESS] Generate short analysis of lyrical themes. | out theme_analysis | api A | args {}
6. [LOCAL] Format summary post content. | out summary_post_content | api A | args {}
7. [WRITE] Publish social media post. | out post_status | api A | args {}

1. [READ] Look up movie title and rating | out movie_ratings | api A | args {"titles": ["Movie1", "Movie2", "Movie3", "Movie4", "Movie5"]}
2. [LOCAL] Find highest rated movie from lookup results | out highest_rated_movie | api A | args {"titles": ["Movie1", "Movie2", "Movie3", "Movie4", "Movie5"]}
3. [WRITE] Schedule event on calendar | out calendar_event | api D | args {"title": "Team Movie Night", "date": "Friday", "time": "19:00", "location": "My Home"}
4. [READ] Get short trailer link for highest rated movie | out trailer_link | api B | args {"tconst": "$highest_rated_movie.tconst", "region": "US", "limit": "1"}
5. [WRITE] Text team members with movie selection and trailer link | out text_message | api E | args {"team_members": ["Member1", "Member2", "Member3"], "movie_title": "Highest Rated Movie", "trailer_link": "Short Trailer Link"}

1. [READ] Retrieve all donors' emails. | out emails | api A | args {}
2. [READ] Fetch monthly donations from various currencies. | out donations | api A | args {}
3. [PROCESS] Convert donations to US dollars. | out converted_donations | api E | args {"from": "donations.currency", "to": "USD"} | deps [2, 3]
4. [PROCESS] Generate PDF receipt for each donor. | out receipt_pdf | api E | args {"file": "$step4.converted_donations", "page": "1"} | deps [4]
5. [WRITE] Upload generated PDF to cloud storage. | out upload_status | api D | args {"name": "$step4.receipt_pdf", "folder": "donation_receipts", "storage": "cloud_storage"} | deps [4]
6. [WRITE] Send email with PDF receipt to donor. | out email_status | api A | args {"file": "$step5.upload_status", "fileUrl": "$step5.upload_status", "Content-Type": "application/pdf", "Accept": "text/html"} | deps [4, 5]
7. [READ] Check for new donors who made their first payment this month. | out new_donors | api B | args {}
8. [WRITE] Add new donors to newsletter list. | out newsletter_status | api A | args {"data": "$step7.new_donors", "apiKeyPublic": "$user.apiKeyPublic"} | deps [7]

1. [LOCAL] Define campaign theme and key messages. | out campaign_theme_and_messages | deps []
2. [READ] Retrieve latest stock images. | out stock_images | api D | args {"term": "campaign theme"}
3. [PROCESS] Create campaign image using selected stock image. | out campaign_image | api C | args {"term": "campaign theme"}
4. [LOCAL] Generate short link for donation page. | out donation_short_link | deps []
5. [LOCAL] Create QR code for donation page. | out qr_code | deps []
6. [WRITE] Publish campaign post on social media. | out social_media_post | api B | args {"secret_key": "your_secret_key", "id": "post_id"}
7. [WRITE] Send email campaign to supporter list. | out email_campaign_sent | api E | args {"title": "Campaign Title", "html": "<html><body>Your email content here</body></html>"}
8. [WRITE] Text volunteers about the campaign. | out text_volunteers_sent | api A | args {"campaign_name": "Campaign Name"}

1. [LOCAL] Define criteria for positivity scoring | params {} | deps []
2. [READ] Retrieve latest news articles | out news_articles | api A | args {}
3. [PROCESS] Analyze each article for mentions of cafe | out cafe_mentions | api C | args {url: $step2.news_articles}
4. [PROCESS] Score each mention based on predefined criteria | out mentioned_scored | api A | args {}
5. [LOCAL] Filter out negative mentions | out negative_mentions | api B | args {criteria: "negative"}
6. [WRITE] Open task for negative mentions | out task_opened | api B | args {keywords: "negative mentions", excluded_keywords: "", period: ""}
7. [READ] Collect recent cafe-related posts | out cafe_posts | api B | args {}
8. [LOCAL] Post collected posts to staff chat | out posts_sent_to_chat | api B | args {}
