10. [LOCAL] Prepare thank-you post with selected quote | out thank_you_post | api B | args {}
11. [WRITE] Schedule weekly publication of thank-you post | out scheduled_post | api B | args {}

1. [READ] Get list of performers and their songs | out performers_list | api A | args {"artistId": "performer_artist_id"}
2. [READ] Retrieve lyrics for each song | out song_lyrics | api D | args {"artistName": "$step1.performers_list[performer_name].artist_name", "songName": "$step1.performers_list[performer_name].song_name"}
3. [PROCESS] Analyze lyrics for strong negativity or explicit content | out analyzed_lyrics | api A | args {}
4. [LOCAL] Flag songs with inappropriate content | out flagged_songs | api B | args {"artistName": "$step3.analyzed_lyrics[artist_name]", "songName": "$step3.analyzed_lyrics[song_name]"}
5. [WRITE] Add open-mic night event to calendar | out calendar_event | api C | args {"calendarId": "open_mic_calendar_id", "name": "Open Mic Night", "description": "Open mic night event", "start": "event_start_time", "end": "event_end_time"}
6. [WRITE] Text each performer their assigned slot | out text_message | api B | args {"appKey": "app_key", "consumerSecret": "consumer_secret", "performerId": "performer_id", "oauthTokenSecret": "oauth_token_secret", "consumerKey": "consumer_key", "oauthToken": "oauth_token", "id": "event_id"}
7. [READ] Get list of volunteers | out volunteer_list | api B | args {}
8. [LOCAL] Prepare running order of songs | out running_order | api D | args {}
9. [WRITE] Post running order to volunteers' chat | out chat_post | api A | args {"message": "Running order for Open Mic Night: $step8.running_order"}

1. [READ] Retrieve 40 donated items with short descriptions. | out items | api B | args {}
2. [PROCESS] Generate illustrations for each item. | out illustrations | api A | args {id: $step1.items.id}
3. [PROCESS] Compile items into a printable catalog. | out catalog | api E | args {}
4. [WRITE] Save catalog to drive. | out drive_link | api A | args {teamDriveId: "your_team_drive_id", fields: "id"}
5. [LOCAL] Create short link for catalog. | out short_link | api A | args {url: $step4.drive_link}
6. [WRITE] Publish post announcing the auction. | out post_status | api B | args {secret_key: "your_secret_key", id: "your_post_id"}
7. [READ] Retrieve list of registered bidders. | out bidders | api C | args {}
8. [WRITE] Email catalog link to registered bidders. | out email_status | api A | args {to: $step7.bidders.email, subject: "Auction Catalog Link", body: "Please find attached the catalog link for the upcoming auction: $step5.short_link"}

1. [READ] Retrieve list of all pets and their vaccination records. | out pets_vaccines | api E | args {}
2. [LOCAL] Define booster vaccination criteria. | out booster_criteria | deps []
3. [LOCAL] Filter pets due for booster within next 14 days. | out upcoming_booster_pets | deps [1, 2]
4. [LOCAL] Identify pets whose owners prefer Spanish. | out spanish_pref_pets | deps [3]
5. [PROCESS] Generate Spanish reminder messages. | out spanish_reminders | api A | args {"text": "Your pet is due for a booster vaccination in the next 14 days. Please schedule an appointment."}
6. [WRITE] Send text reminders to Spanish-speaking owners. | out sms_status | api D | args {"text": "$step5.spanish_reminders.text", "to": "$spanish_pref_pets.owner_phone", "from": "Vet Clinic", "dlr-url": "https://example.com/dlr", "time_to_send": "now", "charset": "UTF-8", "autoconvert": true, "udh": ""}
7. [LOCAL] Track responses from owners who clicked on reminders. | out response_status | deps [6]
8. [LOCAL] Book appointments for pets confirmed to need booster. | out appointment_bookings | deps [7]
9. [READ] Collect list of booked appointments. | out booked_appointments | api B | args {"clinicName": "Vet Clinic"}
10. [WRITE] Schedule email for vets with booster list. | out email_status | api C | args {"data": "Here is the list of pets due for booster vaccinations this week.", "apiKeyPublic": "your_api_key_public", "apiKeyPrivate": "your_api_key_private", "id": "your_campaign_id"}

1. [READ] Get upcoming fixtures for three clubs in fantasy league | out fixtures | api C | args {}
2. [READ] Fetch weather forecast for each match city | out weather_forecast | api D | args {"q": "$step1.fixtures[0].match.city", "units": "metric", "cnt": "5"}
3. [PROCESS] Flag games likely to be played in heavy rain | out flagged_games | api A | args {"city": "$step2.weather_forecast[0].city"}
4. [LOCAL] Create preview PDF combining fixtures and weather info | out pdf_preview | api B | args {"content": "$step1.fixtures", "title": "Fixture Preview", "author": "Fantasy League Team", "subject": "Upcoming Matches Weather Forecast"}
5. [WRITE] Save preview PDF to drive | out pdf_path | api A | args {"path": "preview.pdf", "storageName": "league-pdfs"}
6. [WRITE] Post preview link in league chat | out chat_link | api C | args {"url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/$pdf_path/view?usp=sharing"}

1. [READ] Get tomorrow's weather forecast | out forecast_data | api A | args {"location": "Community Garden Location", "timesteps": "1", "units": "metric"}
2. [READ] Find sunrise time for tomorrow | out sunrise_time | api A | args {"latitude": "Community Garden Latitude", "date": "tomorrow", "longitude": "Community Garden Longitude", "timeZoneId": "UTC"}
3. [PROCESS] Determine if it's a hot dry day | out is_hot_dry_day | api A | args {"longitude": "Community Garden Longitude", "latitude": "Community Garden Latitude", "date": "tomorrow", "units": "metric"}
4. [LOCAL] Calculate watering slot based on sunrise time | out watering_slot | api A | args {"longitude": "Community Garden Longitude", "latitude": "Community Garden Latitude", "date": "tomorrow", "units": "metric"}
5. [WRITE] Add watering slot to garden calendar | out calendar_entry | api A | args {"name": "Watering Slot", "description": "Watering scheduled at $watering_slot", "location": "Community Garden Location", "timezone": "UTC"}
6. [READ] Get list of volunteers | out volunteer_list | api B | args {}
7. [PROCESS] Assign volunteer for the watering slot | out assigned_volunteer | api C | args {"assignment": {"title": "Watering Duty", "description": "Watering scheduled at $watering_slot", "start_date": "tomorrow", "end_date": "tomorrow", "location": "Community Garden Location"}}
8. [WRITE] Text assigned volunteer about their duty | out text_message | api D | args {"to": "$assigned_volunteer.phone_number", "body": "Your duty is to water the garden at $watering_slot tomorrow."}
9. [WRITE] Post note about watering schedule in chat | out chat_note | api B | args {"userId": "$calendar_entry.owner_id", "body": "Watering scheduled at $watering_slot tomorrow."}

1. [READ] Track news articles for mentions of specific ingredients | out news_articles | api D | args {"ingredients": ["ingredient1", "ingredient2"]}
2. [READ] Fetch latest market prices for mentioned ingredients | out market_prices | api C | args {}
3. [LOCAL] Summarize findings into a digest | out digest_summary | api E | args {}
4. [WRITE] Email weekly digest summary to user | out email_status | api E | args {"email": "$user.email", "digest_summary": "$step3.digest_summary"}

1. [READ] Search for latest major scientific breakthroughs in specified field. | out breakthroughs | api A | args {"field": "specified_field"}
