4. [PROCESS] Generate concise summary of each paper's findings. | out summaries | api D | args {"url": "$step3.papers.url"}
5. [LOCAL] Format summary text for readability and brevity. | out readable_summaries | api E | args {}
6. [READ] Retrieve social media post template. | out template | api F | args {}
7. [PROCESS] Personalize social media post with summary and link to papers. | out personalized_post | api G | args {"text": "$step5.readable_summaries", "link": "$step3.papers.link"}
8. [WRITE] Post formatted social media thread. | out post_status | api H | args {"text": "$step7.personalized_post.text", "link": "$step7.personalized_post.link"}

