1. [READ] Retrieve descriptions of dishes for weekly specials. | out dish_descriptions | api E | args {"q": "weekly specials"}
2. [PROCESS] Calculate nutritional facts for each dish. | out dish_nutrition_facts | api A | args {"ingredient": "$step1.dish_descriptions[0].ingredients[0]"}
3. [WRITE] Create photos of each dish. | out dish_photos | api D | args {"image": "$step1.dish_descriptions[0].image_url"}
4. [PROCESS] Generate specials menu page content. | out menu_page_content | api C | args {"title": "Weekly Specials Menu", "description": "Check out our latest specials!", "specials": $step2.dish_nutrition_facts}
5. [WRITE] Upload specials menu page to cloud storage. | out menu_page_url | api B | args {"parentId": "specials_menu", "name": "Weekly_Specials_Menu", "description": "Weekly Specials Menu", "content": $step4.menu_page_content}
6. [WRITE] Share specials menu page URL on social media. | out social_media_link | api A | args {"url": "$step5.menu_page_url"}
7. [WRITE] Compose text message for VIP list. | out vip_message | api B | args {"recipient": "VIP_LIST_EMAIL", "message": "Check out our new specials on our specials menu page: $social_media_link"}
8. [WRITE] Send text message to VIP list. | out sms_status | api C | args {"recipient": "VIP_LIST_PHONE_NUMBER", "message": "$step7.vip_message"}

1. [READ] Retrieve lab report images from patients. | out images | api C | args {"SeriesInstanceUID": "$user.report_uid"}
2. [PROCESS] Use OCR to extract text from images. | out extracted_text | api B | args {"file": "$images"}
3. [PROCESS] Parse extracted text to identify lab test values. | out test_values | api B | args {}
4. [PROCESS] Compare test values against normal ranges. | out range_results | api A | args {"symbol": "HDL", "interval": "1-3", "outputsize": "1", "time_period": "1", "format": "json"}
5. [WRITE] Flag lab results outside normal range. | out flagged_results | api A | args {"symbol": "HDL", "interval": "1-3", "outputsize": "1", "time_period": "1", "format": "json"}
6. [PROCESS] Summarize flagged results for doctor. | out doctor_summary | api B | args {}
7. [WRITE] Book follow-up appointment for flagged results. | out appointment_booked | api A | args {}
8. [LOCAL] Determine patient's preferred language. | out preferred_language | api A | args {}
9. [PROCESS] Translate summary notes into patient's preferred language. | out translated_summary | api B | args {"text": "$doctor_summary", "fromlanguage": "en", "tolanguage": "$preferred_language"}
10. [WRITE] Email translated summary notes to patient. | out email_sent | api A | args {"text": "$translated_summary", "to": "$user.email", "subject": "Lab Report Summary"}

1. [READ] Retrieve new interface strings added by developers. | out new_strings | api C | args {"language": "English"}
2. [PROCESS] Check and fix grammar of English source strings. | out fixed_strings | api A | args {"text": $new_strings}
3. [PROCESS] Translate strings into German, French, and Japanese. | out translated_strings | api B | args {"q": $fixed_strings, "target": "German"} | api B | args {"q": $fixed_strings, "target": "French"} | api B | args {"q": $fixed_strings, "target": "Japanese"}
4. [LOCAL] Ensure placeholders are not broken during translation. | out placeholder_status | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "German"} | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "French"} | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "Japanese"}
5. [LOCAL] Flag translations that exceed UI length constraints. | out long_translations | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "German"} | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "French"} | api B | args {"q": $translated_strings, "source": "English", "target": "Japanese"}
6. [WRITE] Save locale files to cloud storage. | out file_status | api A | args {"your-file": $long_translations} | api A | args {"your-file": $placeholder_status} | api A | args {"your-file": $translated_strings}
7. [WRITE] Open a task for review with translators. | out review_task | api D | args {"locale": "German"} | api D | args {"locale": "French"} | api D | args {"locale": "Japanese"}
8. [WRITE] Notify developers' chat about new tasks. | out notification_status | api E | args {"items": $review_task}

1. [READ] Retrieve team's daily updates. | out updates | api E | args {}
2. [PROCESS] Categorize updates into 'done', 'doing' and 'blocked'. | out categorized_updates | api A | args {"teamId": "teamId"}
