8. [LOCAL] Prepare weekly digest for Friday. | out weekly_digest | api H | args {}
9. [WRITE] Email weekly digest to manager. | out emailed_digest | api I | args {"digest": "$step8.weekly_digest"}

1. [READ] Retrieve early-bird buyers' information | out buyers_info | api D | args {}
2. [WRITE] Create student accounts for early-bird buyers | out accounts_created | api C | args {name: "$buyer.name", idExternal: "$buyer.id"}
3. [WRITE] Add early-bird buyers to course mailing list | out added_to_list | api B | args {address: "course-email-list@domain.com", subscribed: true}
