8. [WRITE] Announce course launch on social media | out announcement_sent | api A | args {}

1. [READ] Retrieve item list from previous inventory. | out item_list | api A | args {warehouse: "current"}
2. [PROCESS] Generate detailed descriptions for each item. | out item_descriptions | api E | args {item_list}
3. [PROCESS] Correct grammatical errors in item descriptions. | out corrected_descriptions | api D | args {text: $step2.item_descriptions}
4. [WRITE] Upload item list to online marketplace platform. | out upload_status | api B | args {uploadfile: $step3.corrected_descriptions}
5. [LOCAL] Create QR code linking to online item list. | out qr_code_url | api C | args {description: $step3.corrected_descriptions}
6. [LOCAL] Design flyer image featuring item list and QR code. | out flyer_image_url | api F | args {item_list: $item_list, qr_code_url: $step5.qr_code_url}
7. [WRITE] Share flyer image on social media platforms. | out social_media_share_status | api G | args {image_url: $step6.flyer_image_url}
8. [WRITE] Text neighbors about yard sale. | out text_status | api H | args {message: "Yard Sale Saturday! Details attached.", recipients: ["neighbor1", "neighbor2"]}

1. [READ] Retrieve GPS sighting data from database. | out sighting_data | api D | args {"startTime": "start_date", "endTime": "end_date"}
2. [PROCESS] Geocode GPS points to create place names. | out place_names | api C | args {"name": "$step1.sighting_data.latitude, $step1.sighting_data.longitude", "lang": "en", "country": "US"}
3. [READ] Fetch weather data for sighting date. | out weather_data | api B | args {"location": "sighting_data.location", "units": "metric"}
4. [PROCESS] Merge weather data with sighting data. | out merged_data | api A | args {"latitude": "$step2.place_names.latitude", "longitude": "$step2.place_names.longitude", "device": "$step1.sighting_data.device_id"}
5. [PROCESS] Clean and deduplicate species names. | out cleaned_species | api A | args {"query": "$step4.merged_data.species_name"}
6. [WRITE] Upload cleaned dataset to cloud storage. | out upload_status | api C | args {"file": "$cleaned_species.csv", "permanent": "true"}
7. [LOCAL] Calculate and format total sightings by species. | out total_sightings | api A | args {"species": "$cleaned_species.species_name"}
